# Authentication

The application implements authentication with support for OAuth providers.

## Frontend Authentication

- [auth/AuthProvider.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/auth/AuthProvider.tsx) - Authentication context provider
- [auth/AuthService.ts](mdc:goweb/src/auth/AuthService.ts) - Authentication service
- [auth/WithAuth.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/auth/WithAuth.tsx) - Authentication HOC
- [app/login/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/login/page.tsx) - Login page
- [app/register/page.tsx](mdc:goweb/src/app/register/page.tsx) - Registration page

## Backend Authentication

- [AuthController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/AuthController.java) - Authentication controller
- [AuthService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/AuthService.java) - Authentication service
- [JwtAuthenticationFilter.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/filters/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java) - JWT filter
- [JwtUtil.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/utils/JwtUtil.java) - JWT utility

## OAuth Providers

- [GoogleOAuthService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/oauth/GoogleOAuthService.java) - Google OAuth
- [GithubOAuthService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/oauth/GithubOAuthService.java) - GitHub OAuth
